    "key": "creatureUndeadTraits",
    "description": "<p><strong>SRD (undead type):</strong> Immune to mind-affecting, poison, sleep, paralysis, stunning, disease, and death effects; not subject to critical hits, nonlethal damage, ability drain, fatigue/exhaustion, or energy drain; uses Charisma for Concentration; darkvision as listed.</p><p><strong>ThirdEra:</strong> Matching typed grants are under <strong>Capability grants</strong>. Mindless undead need additional handling for skills/will (stat block). Many necromancy effects still interact — track exceptions on specific monsters.</p>",
